  "steps": [
    "Press the tofu with a clean towel for 10 minutes to remove excess water, then crumble it with your hands.",
    "Heat the oil in a pan and add the cumin seeds.",
    "Add the onion and green chilli and cook until the onion is soft.",
    "Add the tomato with turmeric, chilli powder, cumin powder and salt and cook until pulpy.",
    "Add the tofu and toss over medium heat for 5-6 minutes until it absorbs the masala and dries slightly.",
    "Finish with lemon juice and coriander leaves."
  ]
